D7AF][/dim]Pressing `v` on the Agents tab paints the hint input bar [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]immediately and renders numbered hints in bounded, cached, off-pump[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]work, so hint latency stops scaling with transcript size, family [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]member count, or auto-refresh cadence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agents_view_hints_perf.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Instrument and baseline the view-hints keypath[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]measure[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]measure: add end-to-end trace spans for the `v` keypath, add a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]view-hints scenario to the TUI trace bench, capture a committed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]baseline, and document the new spans in the perf runbook. No behavior [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]change.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bound hint-mode content and remove per-fragment disk work[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bound[dim] · [dim][/dim]after measure[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bound: apply the normal render path's byte/line caps to hint-mode body [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]content (including family member fragments), hoist per-chunk workspace [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution out of the family hint loop, and memoize hint path [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolution.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Paint the hint bar before rendering the annotated document[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]offpump[dim] · [dim][/dim]after measure[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]offpump: restructure the view-files action so the hint input bar mounts [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]first and the annotated render runs as a pump-free task, with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]readiness guard so an early submission still resolves against complete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hint mappings.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cache the annotated hint document[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bound[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache: memoize the hint render result and wrap the annotated document in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a width-keyed cached renderable so repeat presses, refresh repaints, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-enrichment repaints reuse rendered segments.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop redundant hint re-renders on refresh and enrichment[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]dedupe[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cache, offpump[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]dedupe: skip the full hint document rebuild on Agents-tab refreshes and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]header-enrichment messages whose inputs did not change, and stop the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one-second summary TTL from forcing repeated enrichment while hint mode [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]is active.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify the speedup and guard it[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after dedupe[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: re-run the view-hints bench against the committed baseline, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record the after numbers, add a regression floor, and sync the help [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]popup and perf runbook with any user-visible behavior change.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-a5","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","phase_bead_id":"sase-a5.1","reasoning_effort":"medium","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-19ce27904112a1a7682f8a9fed1f0dc9","started_at":"2026-07-27T18:23:53.609886+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"0d04d9fe2c47b3e853e6038dc8ce79a77a591c28d30b45468f7fcb33af1e85bd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.5/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"899ac7a41cb120dabadf0f7a545c783b88224921615b26dea2cddea9f423a7c9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.5/meta.json","size_bytes":603},"prompt":{"digest":"d01c388936d78197e025face5d713b2f11cdb26675979ca535b6c1056cfffbcd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.5/prompt.md","size_bytes":183},"state":{"digest":"15db29e53245418f6ca1acd36e35fd448f5caeadc8253a663df1dd965acb8221","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.5/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.5","local_name":"sase-a5.5","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-a5","agent_clan_generation":"20260727142339","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-a5.5","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-a5","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-a5.5","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-3d4d65be45b702b1432f29f30c47d606","started_at":"20260727142344","state":"waiting"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"b08839f693d9c91c1bedd8bad0b6b5505049af487657fe6cddf052fdcddf28b5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"8446804ed67220ea13dcf1379eedf3ca25ef53b37ede2f41d0067f7cdb6b09bd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-a5.land/meta.json","size_bytes":584},"prompt":{"digest":"4eac113496dee9c9cb4275127492eae0415f2feca0242e90c6232f2cac925311","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athe